'''Jacob's Farming Contest''' is an [[event]] that takes place every 3 SkyBlock days, and lasts for 20 minutes (real life time), during which three random crops from the [[Collections#Farming Collections|Farming Collection]] are selected for players to collect.

== Mechanics ==
=== Timing ===
The event lasts for {{Green|1 day}} in [[SkyBlock Time]], or {{Green|20 minutes}} in real-life time. The interval of Jacob's Farming Contest is {{Green|3 days}} in [[SkyBlock Time]], or {{Green|1 hour}} in real-life time.

=== Requirements ===
The player needs to be at least {{Skill|Farming|X}} to participate, and must talk to [[Jacob]] at least once. At least 100 of the current event crop must be collected to earn any rewards.

=== Rewards ===
There are 5 brackets of rewards: {{Medal|BRONZE}}, {{Medal|SILVER}}, {{Medal|GOLD}}, {{Medal|PLATINUM}} and {{Medal|DIAMOND}}. Each bracket earns better rewards.

If {{NPCSprite|Finnegan}} is elected as Mayor or Minister with the GOATed perk, the amount of players included in each bracket is increased by up to {{Green|10%}}.

